{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48948","headline":"依韵和干公题庭中太湖石二首 一 · 王贞白","name":"依韵和干公题庭中太湖石二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山立秪盈寻，高奇药圃阴。\n风涛打欲醉，岩穴蛰方深。\n藓点晴偏绿，蛩藏晓竞吟。\n岁寒终不变，堪比古人心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}